ee which can be found exclusively in the underground lake past the Finlay entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>. It is a teal-colored variety of kelp with unique glowing leaves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Unusually, the glowing effect present on the leaves of Luminescent Kelp is not present in its sanded <i>or</i> planked forms, a trait that no other trees with glowing parts possess.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903022616\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019444/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.179      1 Template:Wood\n100.00%   28.179      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4207-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903022616 and revision id 21624. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Trees","Stubs"],"links":[{"title":"Mike's Mines","exists":true}],"images":["Luminescent_Kelp.png"]}
